invariant: INV-61
file: x509_der.c
catches: x509strict_mldsa
reason: the SPKI reader takes an ML-DSA-87 key of any length, so a
  certificate whose key is 2591 or 2593 bytes passes the profile and
  reaches the verifier. test_lengths requires unsupported_certificate
  for both.

--- old
    if (!x509_read_bitstring(&s, &bits, &bits_len) || s.err || rb_left(&s) != 0 ||
        bits_len != 2592) {
--- new
